hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"154","A`ūdhu billāhi minash-shayṭānir-rajīm. ¤ ¤ Seeking refuge with Allah against him (i.e. by saying I seek refuge in Allah from Satan the outcast)."
"155","The call to prayer - 'Athan."
"156","Saying words of Allah's remembrance (Thikr) and recitation of the Qur'an."
